{"abstract":[{"text":"capabilities is the negotiation channel for wire features a peer may not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"understand. A server sets it on the pack it returns to advertise what it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"supports; a client must treat absence as “unsupported” rather than as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“unknown”, because a server that predates a feature cannot say so.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_ChangePack"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"capabilities","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It exists because a server does not store the bytes a client sent: it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"re-encodes from its own domain model, so a field it does not know is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dropped from the stored change log and the push still succeeds. Without a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"handshake a client cannot tell that its restore was silently downgraded to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ordinary insert. Measured against a pinned v0.7.20 server.","type":"text"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/Yorkie_V1_ChangePack\/capabilities","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:6Yorkie0A14_V1_ChangePackV12capabilitiesSaySSGvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"va